    "summary": "The outer frame is Borden waiting to be hanged. Inside it he reads Angier's diary, and inside that diary Angier reads Borden's, so each account sends the viewer back to a different stretch of the feud. The order you learn things in is the trick: the twin secret sits in plain sight while the diaries direct your attention elsewhere.",
