      "summary": "Its standing has grown. The A.V. Club listed it among the best films of the 2000s, Empire placed it in its 21st-century top 100, and the WGA ranked the screenplay 82nd in its 2021 list of the century's best. A 20th anniversary re-release is announced for January 2027."
